slate-200","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink/80","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"AnalytIQ Digital is a Nigerian technology and digital transformation company based in Abuja, working with businesses and institutions on the data, software, and automation problems that quietly cost the most time and money."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Most engagements start the same way: an organisation has grown past what spreadsheets and manual processes can reliably handle, but is not sure whether the fix is a dashboard, a piece of custom software, an AI-powered automation, or something simpler. Our work starts before any tool is chosen — understanding the actual workflow, the actual decision being made, and the actual constraints of the team that has to use whatever gets built."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Our work spans data analytics and Power BI, full-stack web and software development, AI automation, and WhatsApp-based customer assistants. That range matters in practice: a lot of “software problems” are really data problems, and a lot of “we need custom software” requests are better solved with a focused automation instead. Working across all of these means the recommendation fits the problem, not whichever service happens to be on offer."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We work directly with clients on every engagement — the people scoping the project are the people delivering it."}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-12 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Tools & technologies"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3","children":[["$","span","Power BI",{"className":"rounded-full border border-brand/20 bg-surface-off px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-brand","children":"Power BI"}],"$L2","$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"]}],"$Lb","$Lc"]}],"$Ld"]}]}]]}],"$Le"],null,"$Lf"]}],"isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$11","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L12","isPartial":"$@13","staleTim